# Local secrets/config for `wrangler pages dev` (auto-loaded from this directory).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# Phase 3: digithings.ai /chat is an iframe shell — digivault + OpenRouter secrets
# live on the digichat runtime (chat.digithings.ai), not as Pages Function env.
# See docs/superpowers/rollout/2026-08-05-digichat-phase3-ops-checklist.md.
#
# Optional local Pages Function remnants (none required for /chat after Phase 3):

# Build-time (Next.js public env) — set in Pages/CI, not secrets:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DIGICHAT_EMBED_ORIGIN=https://chat.digithings.ai
